{"time": 1771075149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064511846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "旅馆的前台女孩接过你们的证件，动作熟络地登记你们的信息。“你们是第一次来永雾镇玩？感觉你们不像本地人呢——好啦，这是你们的房间钥匙，从这边楼梯上去的三楼就是你们的房间。有什么问题可以随时问我哦。”"}
{"time": 1771075169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980609217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1041335517]（那你rp或者过话术）"}
{"time": 1771075210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284290890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“是啊，老家能闷死个人。”"}
{"time": 1771075224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186627267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“附近有啥好玩的不？”"}
{"time": 1771075265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828962329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“我看报纸说是最近好像有啥地方失踪了几个人？”"}
{"time": 1771075307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269398036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“老姐你也别糊弄俺，咱外地人有没有啥地方要少去的”"}
{"time": 1771075318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458868403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "“我们还是初来乍到，还请小姐多多关照便是......”"}
